		{
			dependencies: ["7735F10E2C20E0C6"]
			description: [
				"Apotheosis rebuilds enchanting, loot and spawners."
				""
				"&dEnchanting&f now has three stats: &cEterna&f (level, up to 100), &bQuanta&f (randomness) and &aArcana&f (rarity and number of enchantments). Special shelves raise each."
				""
				"&6Affix loot&f drops from monsters with random bonuses and &egem sockets&f. Rare &cworld bosses&f carry the best of it."
				""
				"&9Spawners&f can be picked up with Silk Touch and tuned with everyday items."
				""
				"Its guide is the &eApothic Chronicle&f, and JEI shows every infusion, modifier and table recipe."
			]
